          %h2#references References
          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+group"} Simplicial groups
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+principal+bundles"} simplicial principal bundles
            are discussed in
          %ul#May
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+May"}> Peter May
              ,
              %em Simplicial Objects in Algebraic Topology
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.math.uchicago.edu/~may/BOOKS/Simp.djvu"}> djvu
              ).
          %p and section V of
          %ul#GoerssJardine
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Goerss"} Paul Goerss
              and
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Rick+Jardine"} Rick Jardine
              = succeed "," do
                %em Simplicial Homotopy Theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.maths.abdn.ac.uk/~bensondj/html/archive/goerss-jardine.html"} ps
          %p
            The relation of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi W
                  %mi G
                  %mo →
                  %mover
                    %mi W
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ¯
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} W G \to \bar W G
            to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/decalage"} decalage
            is mentioned on p. 85 of
          %ul#Duskin
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Duskin"}> John Duskin
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Simplicial methods and the interpretation of “triple” cohomology
          %p Discrete cohesion is the topic of section 3.1 of
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"}> Urs Schreiber
              ,
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/differential+cohomology+in+a+cohesive+topos"} differential cohomology in a cohesive topos
              ,
          %p where much of the above material is taken from.
